<!-- This file defines the Strategy pattern for algorithms such as shipping cost. -->

# Strategy

When one job has several swappable algorithms, make each algorithm a function with the same contract. Do not spread permanent conditionals through the caller.

```ts
type ShippingStrategy = (order: Order) => number;

const shippingByCity: Record<string, ShippingStrategy> = {
  tehran: () => 0,
  other: (order) => (order.total > 2_000_000 ? 0 : 80_000),
};

function shippingCost(order: Order) {
  return (shippingByCity[order.city] ?? shippingByCity.other)(order);
}
```
